# Support

## Bugs and feature requests

Search the [issue tracker]({{ISSUES_URL}}) before opening a new issue.
Include the lab and step, the environment you used, reproduction steps,
and the expected and actual results.

Remove credentials, subscription and tenant IDs, personal resource identifiers,
customer data, and private information from logs and screenshots.

For security vulnerabilities, follow [SECURITY.md]({{SECURITY_PATH}}) instead of opening a public issue.

